.TH sam-jail-add 1 2026-11-14 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-add \- Create a sandbox for an AppImage: extract, profile, add a menu entry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail add\fR [\fB\-\-allow\-fallback\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-launcher\fR] [\fB\-\-preset\fR] [\fB\-\-accept\fR] [\fB\-\-hide\-duplicates\fR] [\fB\-\-permissions\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-\-progress\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a sandbox for an AppImage: extract, profile, add a menu entry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-fallback\fR
Allow the AppImage\*(Aqs own \-\-appimage\-extract (sandboxed) if static extraction fails
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-launcher\fR
Do not create a desktop launcher
.TP
\fB\-\-preset\fR \fI<PRESET>\fR
Apply a preset instead of the recommended profile
.TP
\fB\-\-accept\fR
Accept the recommended profile (skip "Needs Review")
.TP
\fB\-\-hide\-duplicates\fR
Hide other menu entries that start this AppImage without a sandbox
.TP
\fB\-\-permissions\-stdin\fR
Use the permissions given as JSON on stdin instead of the recommendation
.TP
\fB\-\-progress\fR
Report progress on stderr, one JSON object per line: {"progress": {"step", "steps", "title", "detail", "fraction"}}
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>

